                          stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
                      </svg></span></a></li>
              </ul>

            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="esn-panefoot">

            <span class="esn-panefoot__meta"><b>Every engagement under NDA</b> &middot; your clients never know we
              exist</span>

            <a class="esn-panefoot__cta" href="javascript:;">

              Become a partner<svg class="arrow-icon esn-link__icon" data-icon="arrow" width="17" height="16"
