        <!-- ==========================================
     8. WHY US / NUMBERED ADVANTAGES (#why-us)
     ========================================== -->
        <section class="rv-section rv-bg-white" id="why-us">

          <div class="container">

            <div class="rv-section-head reveal-up">

              <p class="rv-eyebrow">Why Us</p>

              <h2>What makes us different <span class="rv-hl">and why it matters for your store?</span></h2>

            </div>

            <div class="rv-why-list">

              <div class="rv-why-row reveal-up">

                <div class="rv-why-num">/ 01</div>

                <h3>Conversion baked in, not added on.</h3>

                <p>Most agencies build stores and think about conversions later. At Enstacked, conversion is the
                  standard; every layout, every CTA, every checkout flow is built with user behavior and conversion in
                  mind.</p>

              </div>

              <div class="rv-why-row reveal-up" style="--rv-delay: .06s;">

                <div class="rv-why-num">/ 02</div>

                <h3>Delivered fast, without cutting corners.</h3>

                <p>We're built for speed: dedicated teams, clear processes, and a workflow that eliminates
                  back-and-forth without sacrificing quality.</p>

              </div>

              <div class="rv-why-row reveal-up" style="--rv-delay: .12s;">

                <div class="rv-why-num">/ 03</div>

                <h3>One team. Everything eCommerce.</h3>

                <p>From eCommerce development and CRO to digital marketing, UX design, white-label delivery, and our own
                  Shopify products, everything your eCommerce brand needs lives under one roof.</p>

              </div>

              <div class="rv-why-row reveal-up" style="--rv-delay: .18s;">

                <div class="rv-why-num">/ 04</div>

                <h3>100% Transparency, No surprises. Ever.</h3>

                <p>Clear timelines, proactive updates, and a team that communicates. You always know where your project
                  stands, what's next, and who to reach.</p>

              </div>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center u-mt-fluid-lg reveal-up">

              <a href="javascript:;" class="es-btn es-btn--primary">Ready to Get Started?<svg class="arrow-icon"
