        <!-- ==========================================

     SECTION 9: SCHEDULE A CALL

     ==========================================

     Rebuilt on template-parts/sections/section-scheduler.php, 2 Sep 2026, on

     the owner's instruction to give the home page the layout the service

     pages use: the numbered path to a call with the phone tile under it on

     the left, the dark panel holding the booker on the right. What it

     replaces was a bespoke `.rv-call-wrap` card, a second scheduler design

     carrying its own eyebrow repaint, its own spinner and its own fallback.

     The id, the heading and the lede are unchanged. Nothing in the theme

     links to #schedule-call today, checked across every file, but the id

     costs nothing and an external link may still use it.

     Since 11 Sep 2026 this band IS the site-wide scheduler: its steps, its

     phone tile, its booking URL, its compact density and its lazy Calendly

     loader are the partial's defaults, and every other page that books a

     call renders the same partial. This page passes only its own copy. The

     lazy loader and the no-JS fallback that used to live in this file moved

     into the partial with it.

     ========================================== -->

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/section-scheduler.css">
        <noscript>
          <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/section-scheduler.css">
        </noscript>


        <!-- ==========================================
     11. SCHEDULE A CALL CONSULTATION (#schedule-call)
     ========================================== -->
